Package: maexitsv2
Title: Medicare Advantage Plan Exits and Forced Disenrollment
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Matthew", "Lavallee", , "mlavall3@jh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Measures Medicare Advantage (MA) plan exits and the resulting
    forced disenrollment for each December-to-January transition, using CMS
    Monthly Enrollment by Contract/Plan/State/County files, MA landscape
    files, and Part C&D Plan Crosswalks to separate exits
    (terminations, non-renewals, and service-area reductions that drop a
    county) from consolidations and renewals. Provides loaders for the
    processed plan-by-county and county-by-year datasets (downloaded once
    from the package's GitHub data release and cached) and for any month of
    CMS enrollment, filterable by plan, year or month, state, county, and
    variable, plus the pipeline that builds the datasets from the raw CMS
    and NBER files.
